  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Gaza Medical Evacuation Scheme</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Gaza Medical Evacuation Scheme, led by DHSC, relocates Gazan children requiring urgent care to the UK, along with their parents/guardians and siblings under 18, for up to 24 months. Classified as ODA-eligible, the programme supports multiple cohorts under cross-government coordination and ministerial approval.</narrative>
  </description>
